Secondly, shale oil extraction is a cleaner and more environmentally friendly option compared to traditional drilling methods. Modern fracking techniques have significantly reduced the environmental impact of oil extraction, with improved well design, better cementing, and more efficient drilling processes. Additionally, the use of natural gas as a fuel source for power generation has reduced greenhouse gas emissions and air pollution.

